---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Rooted Layers | Selected AI Systems & Engineering Work
description: A selective entrance to Rooted Layers research and engineering work, with source trails and documented contribution.
---
<section class="hero hero--portfolio">
  <div class="hero__copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">Selected technical work</p>
    <h1>AI systems arguments, grounded in the work behind them.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Rooted Layers is a working archive of research and engineering on agent systems, evaluation, and governable software. This entrance highlights the pieces that best stand alone for technical review; Substack remains the canonical publication surface.</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="button" href="{{ archive.portfolio.professionalProfileUrl }}">Professional profile</a>
      <a class="button button--ghost" href="{{ '/archive/' | url }}">Complete archive</a>
      <a class="button button--ghost" href="{{ site.substackUrl }}">Read on Substack</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% if archive.portfolio.flagshipPosts | length %}
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="flagship-heading">
  <div class="section__head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Flagship work</p>
    <h2 id="flagship-heading">The strongest standalone technical arguments</h2>
    <p class="lede">Selected for technical value, distinct contribution, resolved lineage, and an inspectable evidence trail.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="portfolio-grid">
    {% for post in archive.portfolio.flagshipPosts %}
      {% include "partials/portfolio-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if archive.portfolio.supportingPosts | length %}
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="supporting-heading">
  <div class="section__head">
    <p class="eyebrow">Supporting work</p>
    <h2 id="supporting-heading">Useful extensions and adjacent evidence</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="portfolio-grid">
    {% for post in archive.portfolio.supportingPosts %}
      {% include "partials/portfolio-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="section archive-callout" aria-labelledby="archive-heading">
  <div>
    <p class="eyebrow">Historical record</p>
    <h2 id="archive-heading">The complete public archive remains available.</h2>
    <p>Browse every mirrored public essay and series, including work that is not part of this selective entrance. Individual essay pages keep their canonical Substack URL and repository provenance.</p>
  </div>
  <a class="button button--ghost" href="{{ '/archive/' | url }}">Browse the complete archive</a>
</section>
